{% comment %}
  Today's date in a wreath: a ring of leaves on a thin vine with six of the season's flowers or fruit, two kinds in turn, each turned back upright. Each view swaps bc-daysize for its
  value size classes (a capture can't take arguments). stroke="none" on the uses keeps the ring's stroke off the
  filled leaves and daisy hearts.
{% endcomment %}
{% comment %} Two digits get a size smaller, so "28" stays inside the inner circle. {% endcomment %}
{% if bc_today_day > 9 %}
  {% assign bc_ds_big = "value--large lg:value--xxlarge" %}{% assign bc_ds_small = "value--medium lg:value--xlarge" %}
{% else %}
  {% assign bc_ds_big = "value--xlarge lg:value--xxxlarge" %}{% assign bc_ds_small = "value--large lg:value--xxlarge" %}
{% endif %}
{% capture bc_bloom %}
  <div class="bc-bloom relative flex-none">
    <svg class="absolute inset--0 w--full h--full" viewBox="-100 -100 200 200" aria-hidden="true">
      <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
        <circle r="72" stroke-width="1.8"/>
        {% for bc_a in (0..17) %}{% assign bc_m = bc_a | modulo: 3 %}{% if bc_m != 0 %}{% assign bc_side = bc_a | modulo: 2 %}<g transform="rotate({{ bc_a | times: 20 }})"><use href="#bc-leaf" x="-10" y="{% if bc_side == 0 %}-84{% else %}-72{% endif %}" width="20" height="12" stroke="none" transform="rotate({% if bc_side == 0 %}-24{% else %}24{% endif %} 0 -72)"/></g>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        {% for bc_a in (0..5) %}{% assign bc_odd = bc_a | modulo: 2 %}<g transform="rotate({{ bc_a | times: 60 }})"><use href="{% if bc_odd == 0 %}{{ bc_sym_a }}{% else %}{{ bc_sym_b }}{% endif %}" x="-17" y="-89" width="34" height="34" stroke="none" transform="rotate({{ bc_a | times: -60 }} 0 -72)"/></g>{% endfor %}
        <circle r="52"/>
      </g>
    </svg>
    <div class="absolute inset--0 flex flex--col flex--center">
      <span class="value value--tnums bc-daysize">{{ bc_today_day }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
{% endcapture %}

{% comment %} A vine: a wavy stem with leaves and three of the season's symbols. {% endcomment %}
{% capture bc_vine %}
  <svg class="bc-vine w--full" viewBox="0 0 320 44" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M4 30C40 12 70 42 110 26S180 8 214 26S286 40 316 22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <use href="#bc-leaf" x="26" y="13" width="18" height="11" transform="rotate(-25 35 18)"/>
    <use href="#bc-leaf" x="84" y="30" width="18" height="11" transform="rotate(20 93 35)"/>
    <use href="#bc-leaf" x="186" y="6" width="18" height="11" transform="rotate(-20 195 11)"/>
    <use href="#bc-leaf" x="248" y="30" width="18" height="11" transform="rotate(25 257 35)"/>
    <use href="{{ bc_sym_b }}" x="50" y="10" width="30" height="30"/>
    <use href="{{ bc_sym_a }}" x="146" y="2" width="38" height="38"/>
    <use href="{{ bc_sym_b }}" x="274" y="6" width="30" height="30"/>
  </svg>
{% endcapture %}

{% comment %} This month, starting on the calendar plugin's first day of the week: today is bold with a small heart in front, days with something on are underlined. {% endcomment %}
{% assign bc_first_u = bc_ms_ts | date: "%u" | modulo: 7 %}
{% assign bc_lead = bc_first_u | minus: bc_first_day | plus: 7 | modulo: 7 %}
{% capture bc_month %}
  <div class="bc-month grid grid--cols-7 gap--none">
    {% for bc_j in (0..6) %}{% assign bc_k = bc_first_day | plus: bc_j | plus: 6 | modulo: 7 %}<div class="flex flex--center-x flex--center-y"><span class="label label--small lg:label--base text--bold">{{ bc_wd_one[bc_k] }}</span></div>{% endfor %}
    {% if bc_lead > 0 %}{% for bc_j in (1..bc_lead) %}<div class="bc-month__cell"></div>{% endfor %}{% endif %}
    {% for bc_n in (1..bc_mlen) %}{% capture bc_tag %}|{{ bc_n }}|{% endcapture %}
      <div class="flex flex--center-x flex--center-y bc-month__cell">{% if bc_n == bc_today_day %}<span class="label label--small lg:label--base text--bold bc-month__today"><svg class="bc-glyph" viewBox="0 0 24 22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#bc-heart"/></svg>&#8202;{{ bc_n }}</span>{% else %}<span class="label label--small lg:label--base{% if bc_busy contains bc_tag %} bc-busy{% endif %}">{{ bc_n }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
{% endcapture %}

{% comment %}
  The agenda in columns (each view swaps bc-cols for its most columns): a heading per day, then each event with a
  heart in front and when it happens ("09:00 – 10:00", "ab 22:00", "bis 02:00", "ganztags", "Tag 2 von 3").
  Overflow drops what doesn't fit.
{% endcomment %}
{% capture bc_agenda %}
  <div class="columns bc-agenda w--full" data-overflow-max-cols="bc-cols" data-overflow-counter="true">
   <div class="column">
    {% for bc_r in bc_list %}{% assign bc_x = bc_r | split: "¦" %}
      {% if bc_x[0] == "D" %}{% assign bc_wdi = bc_x[2] | plus: 0 %}{% assign bc_dm = bc_x[4] | plus: 0 %}
        <span class="label label--small lg:label--base group-header bc-dayhead" data-group-header="true"><svg class="bc-glyph" viewBox="0 0 24 22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#bc-heart"/></svg>&nbsp;{% if bc_x[5] == "0" %}{{ bc_w_today }}{% elsif bc_x[5] == "1" %}{{ bc_w_tomorrow }}{% elsif bc_lang == "de" %}{{ bc_wd[bc_wdi] }} {{ bc_x[3] }}. {{ bc_mon[bc_dm] }}{% else %}{{ bc_wd[bc_wdi] }}, {{ bc_mon[bc_dm] }} {{ bc_x[3] }}{% endif %}</span>
      {% elsif bc_x[0] == "N" %}
        <div class="item"><div class="content"><span class="description">{{ bc_w_free }} · {{ bc_w_free2 }}</span></div></div>
      {% elsif bc_x[0] == "E" %}
        <div class="item bc-item">
          <div class="icon bc-bullet"><svg class="w--full h--full" viewBox="0 0 24 22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#bc-heart-o"/></svg></div>
          <div class="content">
            <span class="title title--small lg:title--base" data-clamp="1">{{ bc_x[4] }}</span>
            <span class="label label--small lg:label--base bc-when">{% case bc_x[1] %}{% when "A" %}{{ bc_w_all_day }}{% when "P" %}{{ bc_w_day }} {{ bc_x[2] }} {{ bc_w_of }} {{ bc_x[3] }}{% when "R" %}{% render "bc_time", hm: bc_x[2], h12: bc_12 %} – {% render "bc_time", hm: bc_x[3], h12: bc_12 %}{% when "F" %}{{ bc_w_from }} {% render "bc_time", hm: bc_x[2], h12: bc_12 %}{% when "U" %}{{ bc_w_until }} {% render "bc_time", hm: bc_x[3], h12: bc_12 %}{% else %}{% render "bc_time", hm: bc_x[2], h12: bc_12 %}{% endcase %}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
   </div>
  </div>
{% endcapture %}

{% comment %} The next few events in one line each, for the smallest view. {% endcomment %}
{% assign bc_next_count = 0 %}
{% capture bc_next %}
  <div class="flex flex--col gap--xsmall w--full" data-overflow="true">
    {% for bc_r in bc_list %}{% assign bc_x = bc_r | split: "¦" %}
      {% if bc_x[0] == "D" %}{% assign bc_day_rel = bc_x[5] %}{% assign bc_day_wd = bc_x[2] | plus: 0 %}
      {% elsif bc_x[0] == "E" and bc_next_count < 6 %}{% assign bc_next_count = bc_next_count | plus: 1 %}
        <div class="item bc-item">
          <div class="icon bc-bullet"><svg class="w--full h--full" viewBox="0 0 24 22" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#bc-heart-o"/></svg></div>
          <div class="content">
            <span class="label label--small lg:label--base bc-when">{% if bc_day_rel == "1" %}{{ bc_w_tomorrow }} {% elsif bc_day_rel != "0" %}{{ bc_wd[bc_day_wd] }} {% endif %}{% case bc_x[1] %}{% when "A", "P" %}{{ bc_w_all_day }}{% when "U" %}{{ bc_w_until }} {% render "bc_time", hm: bc_x[3], h12: bc_12 %}{% else %}{% render "bc_time", hm: bc_x[2], h12: bc_12 %}{% endcase %}</span>
            <span class="title title--small lg:title--base" data-clamp="1">{{ bc_x[4] }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
    {% if bc_next_count == 0 %}<span class="description">{{ bc_w_nothing }} · {{ bc_w_free2 }}</span>{% endif %}
  </div>
{% endcapture %}

{% comment %} A calendar is chosen but its plugin has sent nothing yet: a single drooping blossom and two lines. {% endcomment %}
{% capture bc_empty %}
  <div class="layout layout--col layout--center gap--small">
    <svg class="w--16 h--16" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M22 60C22 46 26 36 38 30"/><path d="M26 48Q16 44 14 36Q24 38 26 48z" fill="currentColor"/>
      <g transform="translate(44 22) rotate(30)"><ellipse cx="0" cy="-10.5" rx="5.2" ry="7"/><ellipse cx="0" cy="-10.5" rx="5.2" ry="7" transform="rotate(72)"/><ellipse cx="0" cy="-10.5" rx="5.2" ry="7" transform="rotate(144)"/><ellipse cx="0" cy="-10.5" rx="5.2" ry="7" transform="rotate(216)"/><ellipse cx="0" cy="-10.5" rx="5.2" ry="7" transform="rotate(288)"/><circle r="4.6" fill="currentColor"/></g>
    </svg>
    <span class="title text--center">{{ bc_w_error }}</span>
    <span class="description text--center">{{ bc_w_error2 }}</span>
  </div>
{% endcapture %}

{% comment %}
  The weekday in Pacifico, a round script that stays legible on 1-bit screens; asked for over TRMNL's own fonts (a deliberate exception to "use the provided
  fonts"; Pretty Calendar loads a Google font the same way). display=block: the renderer waits for it.
{% endcomment %}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pacifico&display=block" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  /* Custom CSS only where Framework 3.4 has no class; each block says what is missing. */
  /* Script font for the weekday: the Framework has no font-family classes beyond its own fonts. Pacifico has one
     weight; 700 draws it a little heavier (synthetic bold), which keeps it solid on 1-bit screens. */
  .bc-script{font-family:"Pacifico",cursive;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25}
  /* The symbol sheet takes no room: no class hides an element while keeping its defs usable (hidden = display:none breaks <use> in some renderers). */
  .bc-defs{position:absolute;width:0;height:0;overflow:hidden}
  /* Blossom sizes per view and screen: above w--[128px], the largest arbitrary size, and they form one table. */
  .bc-bloom{width:150px;height:150px}
  .view--half_horizontal .bc-bloom,.view--half_vertical .bc-bloom{width:110px;height:110px}
  .view--quadrant .bc-bloom{width:96px;height:96px}
  .screen--lg .bc-bloom{width:300px;height:300px}
  .screen--lg .view--half_horizontal .bc-bloom,.screen--lg .view--half_vertical .bc-bloom{width:220px;height:220px}
  .screen--lg .view--quadrant .bc-bloom{width:190px;height:190px}
  /* Half horizontal: the blossom is at most the height of the cell less room for the weekday under it, so the weekday
     always shows, also in a flat mashup cell. Container units: no Framework class sizes by the space left. */
  .view--half_horizontal .layout{container-type:size}
